{
  "about": [
    "Shared expansion vectors for repeating events (SPEC SCHED-3). The server (functions/src/schedule/recurrence.ts) and the app (Dart form preview) must both produce `expected` from `recurrence` and `times`.",
    "Dates walk from startDate. Daily: every `interval` days. Weekly: byWeekday days (ISO, Monday = 1) of every `interval`-th week counted from the Monday of startDate's week, never before startDate. Skip dates are dropped; `count` counts kept dates. Stops after untilDate, after count dates, 12 months after startDate (month ends clamp), or at 400 dates.",
    "Times are wall-clock in timeZone. An end time not after the start is the next day. All-day: midnight to the next midnight in the zone, with startDate and endDate set. A time that happens twice when clocks fall back is the first one; a time skipped when clocks spring forward moves ahead by the gap."
  ],
